 "text": "Hi, how have you been? Once upon time, in a small wood, there lived family of chipmunks. The dad chipmunk would go out every morning and come back every evening with food for the family. One dark and stormy night, he missed the last step off the tree and fell, breaking his wing. He lay there until morning, too hurt to climb back up. It is. He spent the night there, and the family didn't know where he was. In the morning, they searched for him saddened. I' sorry. We can try something else. How about a story that ends with a warm blanket and a stuffed animal? Sure. Once upon time, there was a dog named Max. He loved to play fetch with a stick, and he fetched the same stick every time. One day, the stick broke, and Max was very sad.",
